        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "code": "controlled_comparison",
      "statement": "In the controlled sandbox comparison, the original Notion configuration failed with the same pattern (resource exists, token valid, integration lacks page access), while the corrected configuration succeeded; this distinguishes page access/configuration from a generic executor failure.",
      "citations": [
        {
